{"ticker":"CCL","updated":"2026-11-27T22:43:12Z","profile":{"longName":"Carnival Corporation Ltd.","shortName":"Carnival Corporation Ltd.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Travel Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.carnivalcorp.com","fullTimeEmployees":160000,"marketCap":37850775552,"trailingPE":12.400881,"forwardPE":10.906625,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.3717527,"pegRatio":0.72,"targetMeanPrice":33.56296,"targetHighPrice":43.0,"targetLowPrice":23.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":27,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.035,"earningsGrowth":0.05,"grossMargins":0.5538,"operatingMargins":0.15923999,"profitMargins":0.113690004,"totalRevenue":27593000960,"beta":2.456,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":34.03,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":21.45,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.14},"summary":"Carnival Corporation Ltd., a cruise company, provides leisure travel services. The company operates through four segments: North America Cruise Operations, Europe Cruise Operations, Cruise Support, and Tour and Other. It operates port destinations and islands, as well as owns and operates hotels, lodges, glass-domed railcars, and motorcoaches. The company offers its services under the AIDA Cruises, Carnival Cruise Line, Costa Cruises, Cunard, Holland America Line, P&O Cruises (Australia), P&O Cruises (UK), Princess Cruises, and Seabourn brands. It sells its cruises through travel agents, tour operators, vacation planners, websites, and onboard future cruise consultants. Carnival Corporation Ltd. was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Miami, Florida.","summary_zh":"嘉年華有限公司是一家遊輪公司，提供休閒旅遊服務。該公司透過四個部門運營：北美遊輪營運部門、歐洲遊輪營運部門、遊輪支援部門以及旅遊及其他部門。該公司經營港口目的地和島嶼，並擁有和經營酒店、旅館、玻璃圓頂火車和長途汽車。該公司以 AIDA Cruises、Carnival Cruise Line、Costa Cruises、Cunard、Holland America Line、P&O Cruises（澳洲）、P&O Cruises（英國）、Princess Cruises 和 Seabourn 品牌提供服務。該公司透過旅行社、旅遊業者、度假規劃者、網站和船上未來的郵輪顧問銷售其郵輪。嘉年華有限公司成立於 1972 年，總部位於佛羅裡達州邁阿密。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"旅遊服務","candle