"2026-01-27","period":"2025-11-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/815097/000081509726000007/ccl-20251130.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Carnival Corporation was incorporated in Panama in 1974 and Carnival plc was incorporated in England and Wales in 2000. Carnival Corporation and Carnival plc operate a dual listed company whereby the businesses of Carnival Corporation and Carnival plc are combined through a number of contracts and through provisions in Carnival Corporation's Articles of Incorporation and By-Laws and Carnival plc's Articles of Association. The two companies operate as if they are a single economic enterprise with a single executive management team and identical Boards of Directors, but each has retained its separate legal identity. Carnival Corporation and Carnival plc are both public companies with separate stock exchange listings and their own shareholders. Together with their consolidated subsidiaries, Carnival Corporation and Carnival plc are referred to collectively in this Form 10-K as \"Carnival Cor","zh":"嘉年華公司於 1974 年在巴拿馬註冊成立，嘉年華有限公司於 2000 年在英格蘭和威爾斯註冊成立。嘉年華公司和嘉年華有限公司經營一家雙重上市公司，嘉年華公司和嘉年華有限公司的業務通過一系列合約以及嘉年華公司公司章程和附則以及嘉年華公司章程中的規定合併。兩家公司的運作就像一個單一的經濟企業，擁有單一的執行管理團隊和相同的董事會，但各自保留其獨立的法律身分。嘉年華公司和嘉年華有限公司都是上市公司，在證券交易所單獨上市，並擁有自己的股東。嘉年華公司和嘉年華有限公司及其合併子公司在本表 10-K 中統稱為“嘉年華公司”"},{"en":"Following a review of the corporate structure, the Boards of Directors of Carnival Corporation and Carnival plc recommended unifying the dual listed company under a single corporate entity, Carnival Corporation, listed solely on the New York Stock Exchange, with Carnival plc as its wholly-owned UK subsidiary. Under this plan, Carnival plc shareholders would receive Carnival Corporation shares on a one-for-one basis, and Carnival plc shares and American Depositary Receipts would be de-listed from both the London Stock Exchange and the New York Stock Exchange, respectively. Carnival Corporation also proposes shifting its legal incorporation from Panama to Bermuda under the name Carnival Corporation Ltd., a jurisdiction widely recognized and aligned with international financial standards. There will be no material changes to the company's business fundamentals, including strategy, underlyin","zh":"在對公司結構進行審查後，嘉年華公司和嘉年華公司董事會建議將這家雙重上市公司統一為單一公司實體嘉年華公司（僅在紐約證券交易所上市），嘉年華公司作為其全資英國子公司。根據該計劃，嘉年華公司股東將一對一地獲得嘉年華公司股票，嘉年華公司股票和美國存託憑證將分別從倫敦證券交易所和紐約證券交易所下市。嘉年華公司還提議將其合法註冊地從巴拿馬轉移到百慕達，名稱為嘉年華有限公司，這是一個得到廣泛認可並符合國際金融標準的司法管轄區。公司的業務基本面（包括策略）不會有重大變化"},{"en":"These proposals will be subject to certain conditions, including the approval of shareholders and receipt of regulatory and UK court approvals. Carnival Corporation and Carnival plc intend to hold meetings of shareholders in April 2026 to consider the proposals. Subject to shareholders approving the proposals and the remaining conditions being satisfied, the company intends to complete the unification and legal incorporation in Bermuda in the second quarter of 2026. More information on the proposed unification and legal incorporation in Bermuda will be included in materials Carnival Corporation and Carnival plc expect to file with the Securities and Exchange Commission (\"SEC\"), which will be available without charge on the SEC's website.","zh":"這些提案將受到某些條件的約束，包括股東的批准以及監管機構和英國法院的批准。嘉年華公司和嘉年華公司計劃於 2026 年 4 月召開股東大會審議這些提案。在股東批准這些提案並滿足其餘條件的前提下，該公司計劃於 2026 年第二季完成在百慕達的統一和合法註冊。有關擬議在百慕達的統一和合法註冊的更多資訊將包含在嘉年華公司和嘉年華公司預計向美國證券交易委員會（「SEC」）提交的資料中，這些資料將在 SEC 網站上免費提供。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-11-30","items":[{"name":"North America","val":17604000000,"zh":"北美洲部門"},{"name":"Europe","val":8467000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Cruise","val":309000000,"zh":"巡航"},{"name":"Tour & Other","val":241000000,"zh":"旅遊及其他"}],"total":26622000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-11-30","items":[{"name":"Cruise Passenger Ticket","val":17419000000,"zh":"郵輪客票"},{"name":"Cruise Onboard & Other","val":9202000000,"zh":"遊輪船上及其他"}],"total":26622000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-11-30","items":[{"name":"US","val":14847000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"All Other Geographic Areas","val":5374000000,"zh":"所有其他地理區域"},{"name":"DE","val":3348000000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"GB","val":3054000000,"zh":"英國"}],"total":26622000000}},"peers":["RCL","NCLH","AAL","DAL","UAL"]}}